  component: Accordion,
  parameters: {
    layout: "centered",
    docs: {
      description: {
        component: "## Usage\n\nArrange interactive headings vertically; each heading reveals its own section of content.\n\n**Import:** `@/registry/erbium/ui/accordion`\n\n**COSS UI page:** [Accordion](https://coss.com/ui/docs/components/accordion)\n\n## Usage\n\n```tsx\nimport {\n  Accordion,\n  AccordionContent,\n  AccordionItem,\n  AccordionTrigger,\n} from \"@/registry/erbium/ui/accordion\";\n```\n\n```tsx\n<Accordion defaultValue={[\"item-1\"]}>\n  <AccordionItem value=\"item-1\">\n    <AccordionTrigger>Is it accessible?</AccordionTrigger>\n    <AccordionContent>Yes. It adheres to the WAI-ARIA design pattern.</AccordionContent>\n  </AccordionItem>\n</Accordion>\n```\n\n## Composition\n\nUse the following composition to build an `Accordion`:\n\n```text\nAccordion\n├── AccordionItem\n│   ├── AccordionTrigger\n│   └── AccordionContent\n└── AccordionItem\n    ├── AccordionTrigger\n    └── AccordionContent\n```\n\n## Base UI documentation\n\nExplore the underlying primitives and their API reference.\n\n- [Accordion](https://base-ui.com/react/components/accordion)",
      },
